## Layout
- The code repository is the folder this session was launched in (beside the `{{CORE_NAME}}` folder).
- `{{PROJECT_DIR}}/docs/` — project wiki. Start with `{{PROJECT_DIR}}/docs/INDEX.md` (one line per page).
